:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=JOBACN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBACN'.Job action
:DATAI VAR=MAXHOP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MAXHOP'.Maximum hop count
:DATAI VAR=DDMACC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DDMACC'.DDM request access
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
